    "OtherAbstract": {
      "Type": "Publisher",
      "Language": "rus",
      "AbstractText": "59 prakticheski zdorovykh lits. U vsekh patsientov byli opredeleny kliuchevye lipidnye pokazateli. Urovni antitel (AT) klassov IgG i IgM k LPNP, modifitsirovannym malonovym dial'degidom (MDA), uksusnym angidridom i gipokhloritom, opredeliali metodom immunofermentnogo analiza. Spetsifichnost' AT proveriali metodom konkurentnogo immunofermentnogo analiza. Tsirkuliruiushchie immunnye kompleksy (TsIK) vydeliali metodom osazhdeniia v poliétilenglikole s posleduiushchim opredeleniem v nikh soderzhaniia kholesterina énzimaticheskim metodom. V syvorotke krovi obsledovannykh lits byli obnaruzheny AT k LPNP, modifitsirovannym gipokhloritom (gipokhlorit-LPNP), kotorye perekrestno ne vzaimodeĭstvovali s modifitsirovannymi MDA (MDA-LPNP) i atsetilirovanymi LPNP (atset-LPNP). Po sravneniiu so zdorovymi litsami i patsientami s doklinicheskim aterosklerozom u bol'nykh IBS byl povyshen uroven' kholesterina TsIK (KhS-TsIK) (p<0,0001) i snizhen (p=0,006) uroven' AT (IgM) k gipokhlorit-LPNP. Obnaruzhena korreliatsiia mezhdu urovniami AT (IgG) k gipokhlorit-LPNP i urovniami AT k MDA- i atset-LPNP. Takzhe nabliudalas' korreliatsiia mezhdu soderzhaniem AT (IgM) k MDA- i atset-LPNP i kontsentratsieĭ kholesterina TsIK (KhS-TsIK). Sviazi mezhdu urovniami AT i lipidnymi pokazateliami ne vyiavleno."
    }
  },
